 {
  "verse_id": "tsa-a07-v01",
  "song": "tsa-a07",
  "verse": 1,
  "lines": [
   "Therein this whole — place-path, illumination-power-born,",
   "rested in consciousness: through its door,",
   "in void, mind, prāṇa, nerve-circles-within,",
   "outside in body up to liṅga-sthaṇḍila-image,",
   "the whole path stands firmly fixed.",
   "Melting that whole path into the body,",
   "the body into prāṇa, that into mind,",
   "that into void — in that consciousness,",
   "all-filled-full-consciousness is attained:",
   "knowing the thirty-six tattvas' own-form,",
   "seeing beyond-it consciousness Supreme-Śiva-formed,",
   "even world-made consciousness would make-known",
   "the beyond-portion-of-knowable — just as some,",
   "taking-as-supreme the māyā-womb-qualified,",
   "Viṣṇu-Brahmā-and-rest. Therefore it must be",
   "by prakriyā-knowledge-endowed."
  ],
  "sanskrit_cite": "tatra samasta eva ayaṃ mūrtivaicitryābhāsanaśaktijo deśādhvā saṃvidi viśrāntaḥ taddvāreṇa śūnye buddhau prāṇe nāḍīcakrānucakreṣu bahiḥ śarīre yāval liṅgasthaṇḍilapratimādau samasto 'dhvā pariniṣṭhitaḥ taṃ samastam adhvānaṃ dehe vilāpya dehaṃ ca prāṇe taṃ dhiyi tāṃ śūnye tatsaṃvedane nirbharaparipūrṇasaṃvit sampadyate ṣaṭtriṃśattattvasvarūpajñaḥ taduttīrṇāṃ saṃvidaṃ paramaśivarūpāṃ paśyan viśvamayīm api saṃvedayeta aparathā vedyabhāgam eva kaṃcit paratvena gṛhṇīyān māyāgarbhādhikāriṇaṃ viṣṇubrahmādikaṃ vā tasmād avaśyaṃ prakriyājñānapareṇa bhavitavyam",
